INSERT INTO `Book_Tab` VALUES (1,5,1,10,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:27','2007-01-22 14:52:31',0,'Animated tutorials and interactive materials to help you review the concepts in your textbook. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','The <b>Tutorials</b> section contains free vocabulary tutorials for each lesson, as well as flashcards and interactive games. Here you will also find animated grammar tutorials for each lesson.'),(2,5,2,20,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:27','2007-01-22 14:52:31',0,'This section has very brief auto-graded <i>practice</i> activities for each section of every lesson in the textbook. It\'s a good idea to do these activities before you go to class or do your homework so that you\'ll be well prepared. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','You may do the <i>practice</i> activities in the <b>Practice</b> section as many times as you\'d like. You\'ll be able to see how well you did in the <b>My Results</b> section; your scores will not be figured into your grade.<br /><br />The <b>Practice</b> section also includes an auto-graded diagnostic quiz. Be sure to complete this on the Supersite. Your results will include an analysis of where you may need further study, as well as recommended materials for you to review.'),(3,5,3,30,1,'2009-10-28 14:22:21','2007-01-22 14:52:31',0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - FOR SALE ONLY</span><br />You must purchase a passcode in order to access the MAESTRO&reg; Web-SAM. Ask your instructor whether it\'s required for your course. If so, the Web-SAM passcode should have been packaged with your textbook, or you may purchase it <a href=\"http://www.vhldirect.com/\" target=\"_blank\">online.</a> <more><b>For more...</b></more>','On the <b>Web-SAM</b> section, there are <i>homework</i> activities for you to complete; these scores will be figured into your grade. You\'ll be able to do each activity twice; the higher of your two scores will be posted to the gradebook as part of your <i>homework</i> grade for the lesson. To make sure you earn the highest grade possible, prepare by viewing any corresponding materials in the <b>Tutorials</b> section and by doing <i>practice</i> activities in the <b>Practice</b> section before completing the activities in the <b>Web-SAM</b> section.'),(4,5,4,40,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:27','2007-01-22 14:52:31',0,'This section includes an auto-graded practice quiz for each lesson. <more><b>For more...</b></more>','To get ready for lesson quizzes or cumulative exams, complete the auto-graded practice quizzes or exams in the <b>Assessment</b> section. You\'ll be able to see how well you did in the <b>My Results</b> section, but the scores will not be figured into your grade.<br /><br />The <b>Assessment</b> section also includes an auto-graded diagnostic quiz. Be sure to complete this on the Supersite. Your results will include an analysis of where you may need further study, as well as recommended materials for you to review.'),(5,5,5,50,1,'2007-08-09 16:32:47','2007-01-22 14:52:31',0,'Keep track of how well you\'ve done on <i>practice</i> and <i>homework</i> activities here. In addition to your scores, you\'ll be able to access any feedback&mdash;written or audio&mdash;that your instructor has provided.',NULL),(6,10,9,10,1,'2009-09-28 21:03:38','2007-01-22 15:15:21',0,'Animated tutorials and interactive games to help you review the concepts in your textbook.',NULL),(7,10,10,20,1,'2009-09-28 21:03:36','2007-01-22 15:15:21',0,'Auto-graded textbook and supplemental activities for every section in the book; grammar and vocabulary practice, pronunciation guides, streaming video, readings with audio, and interactive maps with cultural activities.',NULL),(8,10,11,30,1,'2009-09-28 21:03:38','2007-01-22 15:15:21',0,'Online version of the complete <b>Cuaderno de práctica</b> and <b>Cuaderno de actividades</b>, integrated audio and video components.',NULL),(9,10,12,40,1,'2009-09-28 21:03:38','2007-01-22 15:15:21',0,'Auto-graded vocabulary and grammar quizzes, lesson practice tests, an