height=\"16\" alt=\"Textbook Icon\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\"/> and page numbers, as well as non-textbook practice activities. <more><img src=\"/media/images/common/bluearrow_2right.gif\" id=\"arrow_2\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" alt=\"expand/collapse\" onClick=\"swapArrow(\'bluearrow\', \'arrow_2\');\" /></more>','The activities in the <b>Practice</b> section are organized by sections in the book: CONTEXTOS, FOTONOVELA, CULTURA (and FLASH CULTURA), ESTRUCTURA, ADELANTE, and PANORAMA. Your instructor can assign some or all of the activities in a lesson for credit or a grade, but you can do all activities in the <b>Practice</b> section as many times as you like for practice. You\'ll be able to see how well you did in the <b><a href=\"/home/?tab=MR\"><b>My Results</b></a></b> section.<br /><br />The <b>Practice</b> section also includes an auto-graded diagnostic grammar quiz (<b>Recapitulación</b>). Your results will include an analysis of where you may need further study, as well as recommended materials for you to review.'),(57,19,3,30,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:33','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,'<span style=\"color: red;\">PREMIUM CONTENT - SOLD SEPARATELY</span><br />The Web-SAM section includes all of the activities in the Workbook/Video Manual and Lab Manual, complete with audio and video components. <more><img src=\"/media/images/common/bluearrow_2right.gif\" id=\"arrow_3\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" alt=\"expand/collapse\" onClick=\"swapArrow(\'bluearrow\', \'arrow_3\');\" /></more>','You must <a href=\"/home/?tab=HW\">redeem a passcode</a> to access the MAESTRO&trade; <b>Web-SAM</b>. Ask your instructor whether it\'s required for your course. If required, the <b>Web-SAM</b> passcode is packaged with your textbook. If you need a passcode, you may purchase it online.'),(58,19,4,40,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:33','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,'The <b>Assessment</b> section shows all assigned tests and exams. It also contains one auto-graded vocabulary practice quiz (<b>Repaso</b>), one diagnostic grammar quiz (<b>Recapitulación</b>), and one practice test per lesson. <more><img src=\"/media/images/common/bluearrow_2right.gif\" id=\"arrow_4\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" alt=\"expand/collapse\" onClick=\"swapArrow(\'bluearrow\', \'arrow_4\');\" /></more>','To get ready for tests or exams, you can take the auto-graded practice tests in this section. You\'ll be able to see how well you did in the <b><a href=\"/home/?tab=MR\"><b>My Results</b></a></b> section.'),(59,19,5,50,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:27','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,'Look in this section to see how well you\'ve done, lesson by lesson, on practice and homework activities as well as quizzes and tests. You\'ll find your instructor\'s feedback here as well.',NULL),(60,19,6,32,1,'2007-10-10 16:55:09','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,NULL,NULL),(61,19,7,36,1,'2007-10-10 16:55:09','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,NULL,NULL),(62,19,8,34,1,'2007-10-10 16:55:09','2007-10-10 11:55:09',0,NULL,NULL),(63,16,1,10,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:31','2007-10-18 16:04:33',0,'Animated tutorials and interactive materials to help you review the concepts in your worktext. <more><img src=\"/media/images/common/bluearrow_2right.gif\" id=\"arrow_1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" alt=\"expand/collapse\" onClick=\"swapArrow(\'bluearrow\', \'arrow_1\');\" /></more>','The <b>Tutorials</b> section contains free vocabulary tutorials for each lesson, as well as flashcards and interactive games. Here you will also find animated grammar tutorials for each lesson.'),(64,16,23,20,1,'2009-06-03 20:34:31','2007-10-18 16:04:33',0,'Auto-graded versions of worktext activities, noted by <img src=\"/media/images/common/icon_textbook_16.gif\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"Textbook Icon\" border=\"0\" align=\"absmiddle\"/> and page numbers, in addition to non-worktext practice activities. <more><img src=\"/media/images/common/bluearrow_2right.gif\" id=\"arrow_2\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" alt=\"expand/collapse\" onClick=\"swapArrow(\'bluearrow\', \'arrow_2\');\" />